# exp70 -- experiment-scoped artifact hygiene.
#
# Raw run artifacts, build trees, logs and Ray sessions stay UNTRACKED. Curated evidence
# (per-slice `slice*_curated_evidence.json`), READMEs, launchers and runners stay TRACKABLE.
# Nothing here deletes evidence: ignored files remain on disk for local inspection.

# Slice 0 hardware run artifacts (raw stdout/stderr/rc/work trees from the Linux loopback
# confirmation runs). The tracked record for Slice 0 is upstream_reproducer/README.md.
_exp70_rostam_runs/*
# ... but the runner that produced them is source, not an artifact.
!_exp70_rostam_runs/exp70_slice0_runner.sh

# Reproducer build trees. `build/` is already covered by the repository-root .gitignore;
# the versioned variants are not, and they contain compiled binaries.
upstream_reproducer/build*/

# Per-slice raw run areas are also ignored by each slice's own .gitignore; repeated here so
# the rule survives if a slice directory is ever added without one.
_exp70_slice*_runs/

# Generic build / log / session noise anywhere under exp70.
**/CMakeFiles/
**/CMakeCache.txt
**/cmake_install.cmake
**/Makefile
*.log
logs/
session_*/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.so
*.dylib
*.o
